# Serverless Cost Optimizer & Security Auditor

## Objective

The objective of this project is to implement a serverless governance solution that automatically audits AWS resources for cost optimization and security-related findings.

The solution performs automated inspections of cloud resources, generates reports, and delivers notifications to administrators without requiring any server infrastructure.

---

# Architecture Components

## AWS Lambda

Performs cost and security auditing logic.

## IAM Role

Grants Lambda permission to inspect AWS resources and publish notifications.

## Amazon SNS

Delivers audit reports via email.

## Amazon EventBridge

Triggers Lambda executions automatically based on a schedule.

## Amazon CloudWatch

Stores Lambda execution logs and operational metrics.

